ore on AG News.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_028_s15","report_id":"v3feat_028","text":"CNN achieves 79.6% F1 score on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null}]}